---
---

<section class="ancestro-coin">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Carbon-Backed <span class="highlight">Digital Infrastructure</span></h2>

    <div class="coin-content">
      <div class="coin-info">
        <p class="intro">
          Ancestro has developed <strong>Ancestro Coin</strong>, a digital asset backed by verified carbon credits.
        </p>
        <p class="purpose-label">Its purpose is not speculation — but:</p>
        <ul class="purpose-list">
          <li>
            <span class="purpose-icon">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5"/></svg>
            </span>
            Carbon monetization
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="purpose-icon">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5"/></svg>
            </span>
            Ecosystem incentives
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="purpose-icon">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5"/></svg>
            </span>
            Long-term alignment across stakeholders
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="integration-note">
          The coin integrates directly into the Ancestro platform and carbon strategy as the network scales.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="coin-cta-card">
        <div class="coin-badge">ANC</div>
        <h3>Buy Ancestro Coin</h3>
        <p class="discount">Currently offered at a <span>33% discount</span></p>
        <a href="/presale" class="cta-coin">
          Buy ANC Coin
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ancestro-coin {
    padding: 100px 24px;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-white);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .coin-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .coin-info {
    padding: 40px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 20px;
  }

  .intro {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .intro strong {
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .purpose-label {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .purpose-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .purpose-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
  }

  .purpose-icon {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
  }

  .integration-note {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .coin-cta-card {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(248,176,59,0.08) 0%, rgba(248,176,59,0.02) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(248,176,59,0.2);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 40px;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .coin-badge {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-black);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 800;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .coin-cta-card h3 {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .discount {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  }

  .discount span {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cta-coin {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-black);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .cta-coin:hover {
    background: #ffbe4d;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(248,176,59,0.3);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ancestro-coin {
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .coin-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .coin-info {
      padding: 28px 24px;
    }

    .coin-cta-card {
      padding: 32px 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
